WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.150
On your iPhone or iPad, scan the beta QR code.

00:00:04.817 --> 00:00:07.017
Open the link in TestFlight.

00:00:07.683 --> 00:00:10.958
Tap Accept to join the Jesus Film Watch beta.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:14.417
You’re in. Now switch to your Apple TV.

00:00:15.083 --> 00:00:19.283
On Apple TV, open the App Store and search for TestFlight.

00:00:24.083 --> 00:00:26.733
Download TestFlight, then open it.

00:00:29.083 --> 00:00:36.508
On Apple TV, choose the profile that uses the same Apple Account as TestFlight on your iPhone or iPad.

00:00:37.183 --> 00:00:39.233
Choose Jesus Film Watch.

00:00:41.183 --> 00:00:44.658
Select Install, and wait for the download to finish.

00:00:45.317 --> 00:00:47.717
Open Watch. You’re ready to go.
